>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `NARROWING_TAC`

``` hol4
Refute.NARROWING_TAC : Abbrev.tactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Runs native symbolic narrowing on the current tactic goal.

`NARROWING_TAC` is `REFUTE_TAC_WITH [upd_search (Only [Narrowing])]`:
it runs only the `narrowing` backend, with every other field of
`!Refute.the_config` as read when the tactic is applied, `quiet` and
`expect` included.  It prints the resulting `Counterexample`,
`NoCounterexample`, or `Unknown` report and then behaves as `ALL_TAC`,
never closing or altering the goal; a counterexample is not a tactic
failure.  Narrowing accepts goals the executable backends decline,
including prenex existentials when `allow_existentials` is true.

### Failure

Fails only when a non-default `expect` field is not met.  Interrupts
are re-raised.

